niri — https://github.com/YaLTeR/niri
  Copyright (c) Ivan Molodetskikh and niri contributors
  License: GPL-3.0-or-later
  Ported / adapted files:
    src/utils/signals.rs   <- niri src/utils/signals.rs
    src/utils/spawn.rs     <- niri src/utils/spawning.rs (double-fork, sigmask reset)
    src/utils/region.rs    <- niri src/utils/region.rs (region to disjoint rectangles)
    src/core/output.rs     <- niri src/niri.rs (RedrawState state machine, frame callbacks)
    src/backend/udev.rs    <- niri src/backend/tty.rs (session resume, estimated vblank timer)
    src/core/render.rs     <- niri src/backend/mod.rs, src/render_helpers/mod.rs
    src/core/render/elements.rs      <- niri src/render_helpers/clipped_surface.rs
    src/core/render/decorations.rs   <- niri src/render_helpers/{border,shadow,blur}.rs
    src/core/render/blur.rs          <- niri src/render_helpers/{blur,framebuffer_effect}.rs
    src/core/render/shaders.rs       <- niri src/render_helpers/shaders/mod.rs
    src/core/render/visual.rs        <- niri src/utils/mod.rs (CornerRadius)
    src/core/render/shaders/*.frag   <- niri src/render_helpers/shaders/*.frag
    src/core/ui/toast.rs             <- niri src/ui/config_error_notification.rs
    src/core/window.rs               <- niri src/window/unmapped.rs, src/handlers/compositor.rs
    src/core/ipc/server.rs           <- niri src/ipc/server.rs (per-client calloop sources,
                                        bounded write queue, slow-client disconnect)
    src/core/ipc/events.rs           <- niri src/niri.rs (state snapshots for the event stream;
                                        the diffing itself is poly's own design)
    poly-ipc/src/protocol.rs         <- niri-ipc/src/lib.rs (request/reply/event types)
    poly-ipc/src/socket.rs           <- niri-ipc/src/socket.rs (socket path convention, client)
    poly-ipc/src/state.rs            <- niri-ipc/src/state.rs (EventStreamState client mirror)
    src/core/handlers/image_copy_capture.rs
                                     <- niri src/handlers/image_copy_capture.rs (ext-image-copy-capture
                                        handlers: on-demand render straight into the client's buffer,
                                        cursor via the session's paint-cursors option)

Smithay / anvil — https://github.com/Smithay/smithay
  Copyright (c) 2017 Victor Berger and Victoria Brekenfeld
  License: MIT
  Adapted:
    src/backend/udev.rs    <- anvil/src/udev.rs (device/connector setup)
    src/core/cursor.rs     <- anvil/src/cursor.rs (xcursor loading)
    resources/cursor.rgba  <- anvil/resources/cursor.rgba (fallback cursor)
